{
	"itemName": "Mount Cosmetic: Midnight Mare",
	"description": "",
	"use": "NSLOCTEXT(\"[D20C99C24B2FABB4DC05E3BF1EE067C5]\", \"031EF9224380BE4F718699A2E347F189\", \"This cosmetic will override the visual look of your ground mount.\")",
	"details": "",
	"flavor": "NSLOCTEXT(\"[D20C99C24B2FABB4DC05E3BF1EE067C5]\", \"E65E0F204472EF0A827D0EBB4DC34A3B\", \"Cloaked in velvety shadow and gleaming like obsidian under moonlight, the Midnight Mare is a steed bred for the quiet hours. It moves with uncanny silence, its hooves scarcely making a sound as it glides across the earth like a living whisper. Though calm in manner, there is a chill in the air when it passes, as if the night itself rides with it. Many believe the mare draws power from the moon above, growing faster and more elusive as dusk deepens. A favorite among silent riders and shadowy messengers, it is as unsettling as it is elegant. This cosmetic will override the visual look of specific mounts when you equip it.\")",
